{"id":"vod_lz_57411","vodId":"57411","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"七龙珠","name_cn":"七龙珠","date":"1986-01-01","year":"1986","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230413-1/b7c95786f1192cab7c4abb37802ce1d4.jpg"},"summary":"　　很久很久以前，曾流传着这样一个传说：世界各地散落着七颗龙珠，只要集齐这些珠子，就可召唤出神龙，而神龙可以帮助你实现任何一个愿望。　　住在深山中的小悟空本领高强，偶然的机会他随时尚少女布尔玛走出大山，四处寻找传说中的龙珠。期间碰上好色的鬼仙人与乌龙、一碰女人就面红耳赤的乐平、自大的小和尚克林，经历了各种各样的艰险和奇遇，也惹出一连串爆笑的故事。当然还有许多邪恶的家伙为了满足私欲寻找龙珠，与小悟空他们展开了连番激斗……　　根据鸟山明同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画,奇幻,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-07-01 14:32:12","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":153,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22943_95399124/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22946_81b07752/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22945_9f459e10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22944_ad4231e9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22947_55894b0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22948_18020c63/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22950_401c0b3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22949_b29c377f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22951_c45a3306/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22952_62982cad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22953_17977eb7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22954_43df29a4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22955_b45edae2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22956_c5f326c8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250629/22958_48c1e5f5/index.m3